        "ggFmE8A3bHJ_srcSet_mobile_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/FuF_review_nam_3.webp?v=1770883890",
        "ggtGmZIUoff_text": "<p><strong>The Fog Lifted. Then Everything Else Followed.</strong></p>",
        "ggxtCokwx1K_text": "<p>The brain fog is what got me. I'm a contractor and I need to be sharp on the job. After about 10 days on Shilajit I noticed I wasn't losing my train of thought. Focus came back. Bonus: my drive came back too.</p>",
