        "gg45PUHNS82_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/7_3.webp?v=1771829408",
        "gg45PUHNS82_srcSet_mobile_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/FuF_review_nam_1.webp?v=1770883536",
        "ggLV_s98MaQ_text": "<p><strong>I Wasn't a Non-Responder. I Was a Scam Victim</strong></p>",
        "ggp_xFxV3G9_text": "<p>I trusted influencers. Bought what they promoted. Defended it to my gym friends. \"You don't understand bioavailability!\" Then the testing came out. <strong>ZERO SHILASHIT.</strong> I wasn't a non-responder. I was a scam victim. ShilaSource shows their lab reports. My deadlift is up 25lbs. My trust in influencers is gone forever.</p>",
